e-id="z6qnZM1VXfpKaemv" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-z6qnZM1VXfpKaemv"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Can you help me create a Bio? On the premise of the page being "news you probably missed."</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="b21e426c-ea9a-4773-ac68-80984f28ad6b" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-b21e426c-ea9a-4773-ac68-80984f28ad6b"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Here are a few options, from shortest to fuller. Facebook gives you roughly 255 characters in the bio field and about 101 in the short description that sits under your page name — so if you like one of these, I'd use a trimmed version of it in the short description and the full one in the bio.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Tight and clean (short description)</span></p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>News you probably missed.</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>The stories that slid past your feed.</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>World news, off the front page.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Full bios, different voices</span></p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Sober and credible</span></p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>News you probably missed. We surface underreported stories from around the world — the ones that didn't trend, didn't get the panel discussion, and didn't stay in the feed for an hour. Sourced, contextualised, no shouting.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Warm and human</span></p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>Most of the world's news never reaches you. We go looking for it. Underreported stories from everywhere, shared in plain language, with the context to make sense of them. News you probably missed.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Punchy and shareable</span></p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>The news that didn't trend. 🌍 Underreported stories from around the world — because "viral" and "important" are different things. News you probably missed.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Short and intriguing</span></p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>The headlines you'd have seen if the headlines had room. News you probably missed.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">One thing worth flagging</h2>
<p>"News you probably missed" is a promise about <em>you</em>, not about the story — which is a good thing. It's a softer claim than "the media won't tell you," and it can't really be proven wrong: if someone did see it, no harm done. Keep that framing and you avoid the credibility problem that catches a lot of pages in this space.</p>
<p>The other half of the promise is what you'll need to keep up. If everything you post is genuinely sourced with links, the bio does the marketing for you and the comment section becomes an asset rather than a battlefield.</p>
<p>Want me to draft an "About" section in the longer-form Facebook field, or a pinned intro post that sets the tone for new followers?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.