ejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="YiP6UHPjqE4piatL" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-YiP6UHPjqE4piatL"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>What would be the best way for me to turn this into my own website with my own articles without having to pay? Just a nice simple, clean and presentable website with links to my articles and date order.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="41595f68-47f5-43e8-884f-025c5cc76357" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-41595f68-47f5-43e8-884f-025c5cc76357"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>The short answer: <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">GitHub Pages + a static site generator</span>, hosted free, with your articles written in plain Markdown files. That's the setup that best matches what you described — free forever at your scale, clean, and automatically in date order with no database or CMS to maintain.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Why this one</h2>
<p>A blog where you post a few articles a week is served perfectly by static hosting. There is no server to pay for, nothing to patch, and it loads faster than most paid WordPress sites. The trade-off is that you edit files rather than type into a web form — but that's also what keeps it simple.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The stack, all free:</span></p>






























<div class="my-4 flex flex-col space-y-2" data-streamdown="table-wrapper"><div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1"><div class="relative"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer select-none appearance-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent] disabled:opacity-60 h-auto w-auto rounded-lg p-1.5 text-gray-800 hover:bg-[#efefef] dark:text-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-100/10 [&amp;_svg]:size-[17px]" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-testid="table-copy" type="button" data-state="closed"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='h-'])]:h-4 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='w-'])]:w-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="relative"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer select-none appearance-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent] disabled:opacity-60 h-auto w-auto rounded-lg p-1.5 text-gray-800 hover:bg-[#efefef] dark:text-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-100/10 [&amp;_svg]:size-[17px]" aria-label="Download" data-testid="table-download" title="Download" type="button"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='h-'])]:h-4 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='w-'])]:w-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15V3"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table data-streamdown="table"><thead class="bg-muted/80" data-streamdown="table-header"><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><th class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm" data-streamdown="table-header-cell">Piece</th><th class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm" data-streamdown="table-header-cell">What it does</th><th class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm" data-streamdown="table-header-cell">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border" data-streamdown="table-body"><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">GitHub</span></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Stores your articles as text files</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Free</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Jekyll / Hugo / Eleventy</span></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Turns those files into a website</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Free</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">GitHub Pages</span></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Hosts and serves the site</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Free</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Your domain</span></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Optional vanity address</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">~£8–12/yr</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p>Everything except the domain is genuinely free with no time limit — not a trial. If you skip the custom domain you get <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">yourname.github.io</code> for nothing.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">How it actually works</h2>
<p>You write each article as a plain text file with a small header at the top:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="markdown" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="markdown" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">markdown</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-markdown overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="markdown" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-markdown bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-light-font-weight: bold; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF; --shiki-dark-font-weight: bold;">---</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">title: "What happened in Kisangani last month"</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">date: 2026-10-03</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">source: "[</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-light-text-decoration: underline; --shiki-dark: #DBEDFF; --shiki-dark-text-decoration: underline;">example.com</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">](</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-light-text-decoration: underline; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8; --shiki-dark-text-decoration: underline;">https://example.com/original-report</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">)"</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-light-font-weight: bold; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF; --shiki-dark-font-weight: bold;">---</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none">
</span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">Your article text goes here. </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-light-font-weight: bold; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8; --shiki-dark-font-weight: bold;">**Bold**</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">, </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-light-font-style: italic; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8; --shiki-dark-font-style: italic;">*italics*</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">, [</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-light-text-decoration: underline; --shiki-dark: #DBEDFF; --shiki-dark-text-decoration: underline;">links</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">](</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-light-text-decoration: underline; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8; --shiki-dark-text-decoration: underline;">https://example.com</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">),</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">images, and quotes all work.</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>The generator collects every file, sorts them by the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">date</code> field, builds your homepage as a reverse-chronological list, and gives each article its own page. Add a new file, the site updates. That's the whole workflow.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Jekyll</span> is the safest default here — it's built into GitHub Pages, so there's no build pipeline to configure. <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Hugo</span> builds faster and has more themes. <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Eleventy</span> is the most flexible if you're comfortable with JavaScript. Any of the three will do what you want, and you can switch later without rewriting your articles, since they're just Markdown.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">The simplest path to a clean look</h2>
<p>Don't design it yourself. Pick a free theme and change two things — your logo and your colours:</p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong"><button data-state="closed"><a class="border-border bg-background text-dark hover:border-semidark dark:text-foreground inline-flex h-4.5 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs no-underline transition-colors dark:border-[#242424] dark:hover:border-gray-500" href="https://github.com/barryclark/jekyll-now" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="max-w-[180px] truncate">Jekyll Now</span></a></button></span> — one of the easiest starting points; you fork it and edit one config file</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong"><button data-state="closed"><a class="border-border bg-background text-dark hover:border-semidark dark:text-foreground inline-flex h-4.5 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs no-underline transition-colors dark:border-[#242424] dark:hover:border-gray-500" href="https://github.com/jekyll/minima" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="max-w-[180px] truncate">Minima</span></a></button></span> — the default Jekyll theme, deliberately plain and readable</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong"><button data-state="closed"><a class="border-border bg-background text-dark hover:border-semidark dark:text-foreground inline-flex h-4.5 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs no-underline transition-colors dark:border-[#242424] dark:hover:border-gray-500" href="https://themes.gohugo.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="max-w-[180px] truncate">Hugo themes</span></a></button></span> — filter by "blog" and look for ones with high star counts</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong"><button data-state="closed"><a class="border-border bg-background text-dark hover:border-semidark dark:text-foreground inline-flex h-4.5 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs no-underline transition-colors dark:border-[#242424] dark:hover:border-gray-500" href="https://github.com/11ty/eleventy-base-blog" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="max-w-[180px] truncate">Eleventy Starter</span></a></button></span> — minimal and fast</li>
</ul>
<p>Aim for: serif or clean sans-serif body text, generous line spacing, the article date visible under each headline, and your navy-and-cream palette from the logo. That's what makes it look considered rather than homemade.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Honest trade-offs</h2>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Learning curve:</span> expect an afternoon to get the first version live. The GitHub web interface lets you create and edit files in the browser, so you don't strictly need to install anything.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">No comments, no scheduling:</span> you'd add a free service like Giscus for comments later if you want them.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Editing on your phone is awkward</span> — fine for a typo, not for writing a full piece.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The custom domain is the only real cost</span>, and it's the one thing that makes it look professional. You can start on <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">github.io</code> and add a domain whenever you're ready.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">What I'd do</h2>
<p>Start with Jekyll Now on GitHub Pages, no domain, one article filed to test the flow. If the workflow feels fine after a week, buy the domain and point it there. Nothing you write in that week becomes wasted work.</p>
<p>If you want, I can write the specific config file you'd need to set "Beyond The Fold" as the site title with your palette — it's a short block of text and I'd need to know whether you're going Jekyll, Hugo or Eleventy first.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="04SqhUj9FugqK3fb" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-04SqhUj9FugqK3fb"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>I will start with Jekyll now if you think that's the easiest. Can you also provide me a step by step guide with the config file?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="36fadfc3-3d1e-4dfd-a89b-4dc45b09df85" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-36fadfc3-3d1e-4dfd-a89b-4dc45b09df85"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Jekyll is the right call — it's built into GitHub Pages, so there's no build step to configure and nothing to install locally if you don't want to.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 1 — Create a GitHub account and fork Jekyll Now</h2>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Make a free account at <button data-state="closed"><a class="border-border bg-background text-dark hover:border-semidark dark:text-foreground inline-flex h-4.5 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs no-underline transition-colors dark:border-[#242424] dark:hover:border-gray-500" href="https://github.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="max-w-[180px] truncate">github.com</span></a></button> if you don't have one.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Go to <button data-state="closed"><a class="border-border bg-background text-dark hover:border-semidark dark:text-foreground inline-flex h-4.5 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs no-underline transition-colors dark:border-[#242424] dark:hover:border-gray-500" href="https://github.com/barryclark/jekyll-now" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="max-w-[180px] truncate">github.com/barryclark/jekyll-now</span></a></button> and click <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Fork</span> (top right). This copies the whole site into your own account.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">In your fork, click <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Settings</span> → <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">General</span> → scroll to <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Repository name</span> and rename it to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">beyondthefold.github.io</code>, replacing <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">beyondthefold</code> with your actual GitHub username. The exact format matters — GitHub only serves a site free at this address if the repo is named <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">&lt;username&gt;.github.io</code>.</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 2 — Turn on GitHub Pages</h2>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Still in <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Settings</span>, click <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Pages</span> in the left sidebar.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Under <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Branch</span>, choose <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">master</code> and leave the folder as <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">/ (root)</code>. Click <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Save</span>.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Wait about a minute, then visit <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">https://&lt;your-username&gt;.github.io</code>. You should see the default Jekyll Now blog with placeholder posts. Nothing you do after this can break it permanently — every change is reversible.</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 3 — Edit the config file</h2>
<p>In your repo, click the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_config.yml</code> file, then the pencil icon to edit it. Replace its contents with this, keeping the indentation exactly as shown:</p>
