xt-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #6F42C1; --shiki-dark: #B392F0;">style</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">=</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"max-height:60px;"</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">&gt;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">&lt;/</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">a</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list" start="4">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Commit, wait a minute, reload.</li>
</ol>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Recolour the theme:</span></p>
<p>This happens in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code>, not <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_config.yml</code>. Open it and find the block of colour variables near the top — the theme defines its own <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$brand-color</code>, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$text-color</code> and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$background-color</code>. Change those values to yours:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">scss</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-scss overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-scss bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$brand-color</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#12284B</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$text-color</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#1A1A1A</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$background-color</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#FBF8F1</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>If you can't find them, search the file for <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">#</code> and look for hex colours — that's where the theme's palette lives. Change them one at a time and reload, so you can see what each one controls.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 6 — Make it look considered</h2>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Body width.</span> In <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code>, find <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.wrapper</code> and set <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">max-width: 700px;</code>. Your current line length is a touch wide for comfortable reading — 700px is the sweet spot.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Line spacing.</span> Add <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">line-height: 1.7;</code> to the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> rule. Small change, large improvement.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Date under each headline.</span> Open <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">index.html</code> and find the post loop — it'll look roughly like <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">{% for post in site.posts %}</code>. Inside it, under the title, add:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="html" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="html" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">html</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25