span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">&gt;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">  &lt;</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">img</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #6F42C1; --shiki-dark: #B392F0;">src</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">=</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"{{ site.baseurl }}/images/logo.png"</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #6F42C1; --shiki-dark: #B392F0;">alt</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">=</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"Beyond The Fold"</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #6F42C1; --shiki-dark: #B392F0;">style</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">=</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"max-height:60px;"</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">&gt;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">&lt;/</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">a</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Commit, reload after a minute, and your logo should sit at the top left. If it shows as a broken image icon, the filename or path doesn't match — tell me and we'll check it.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="DGsf7aKlzJijy1oJ" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-DGsf7aKlzJijy1oJ"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>I physcially cannot click on it</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="d8f768de-4683-47ea-9e55-804ff30af632" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-d8f768de-4683-47ea-9e55-804ff30af632"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That filename field on GitHub's upload page is read-only — it displays what you dragged in, and you can't edit it there. The rename happens <em>after</em> the upload, not before.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">So: commit it as it is.</span> Click <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Commit changes</span> with the long name. It doesn't matter that the name is ugly for a moment.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Then rename it:</span></p>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Go into the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">images</code> folder.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Click on the file with the long name to open it.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Click the <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">pencil icon</span> near the top right.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">At the top of the edit view there's a filename box — that one <em>is</em> editable. Change the whole name to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">logo.png</code>.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Scroll down, commit.</li>
</ol>
<p>That's the reliable route: upload first, rename in the file editor second.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">One thing to check when you rename:</span> if GitHub appends the original extension, you may end up with <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">logo.png.jpeg</code>. If that happens, rename it again and delete the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.jpeg</code> — the extension is part of the name, and your header code needs to match it exactly.</p>
<p>Once you have <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">images/logo.png</code> sitting in the folder, you're ready for the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_layouts/default.html</code> edit. Tell me when the rename is done and I'll walk you through that.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Separately, a heads-up on a different route that avoids all this:</span> you have the generated logo saved as an image in this chat. You could open that image, save it to your computer as <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">logo.jpg</code>, and then upload it already-named — dragging a file that's already correctly named means no renaming step at all. Whichever is easier for you.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="O5LuXafGAMHrIoDS" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-O5LuXafGAMHrIoDS"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>rename is done</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="db04d9e0-eb3a-4cac-af7d-7730dbc2201b" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-db04d9e0-eb3a-4cac-af7d-7730dbc2201b"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Now the header edit.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Open <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_layouts/default.html</code></span> and find the line that renders your site title in the header. In Jekyll Now it looks like this:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="html" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="html" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">html</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25