<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">If the paste keeps garbling</span>, the more reliable route is the config file: leave line 22 as the original <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">{{ site.avatar }}</code> and instead add one line to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_config.yml</code>:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">yaml</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-yaml overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-yaml bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">avatar</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"/images/logo.png"</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>That avoids touching the HTML twice. Either way works — but the line-22 edit above is fine if you delete both broken lines cleanly first.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="k7rarLM4CIhrPRNj" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_82f7d099-15ba-4d56-8f0e-a3dbb0c658cc-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end hidden" id="message-k7rarLM4CIhrPRNj"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="2b7a3828-d565-43d0-bc93-cfbc3caa1d01" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-2b7a3828-d565-43d0-bc93-cfbc3caa1d01"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That's clean — line 22 is now a single correct line, line 23 is empty, and line 25 has the text title back. Commit it.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">After committing</span>, wait a minute and reload. You should see the logo mark sitting to the left of "Beyond The Fold" written out in text, with your description underneath and the nav on the right.</p>
<p>Two things to expect:</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The logo will probably be circular.</span> Jekyll Now styles <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.site-avatar img</code> with a <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">border-radius: 50%</code>, so your square logo gets cropped to a circle. Given your mark has a white background and a square-ish composition, the crop may look odd. To square it off, open <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code>, find <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.site-avatar img</code>, and change the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">border-radius</code> value to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">4px</code>.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">It may still be small.</span> The avatar slot is typically around 40–60px. If it's not giving you enough presence, the honest conclusion is that the mark doesn't read at header size — which is a design issue rather than a sizing one.</p>
<p>If that's what you find, I can generate a simplified version built specifically to work at small scale: the "Beyond The Fold" wordmark alone in your navy, or just the folded-corner motif without the globe and linework inside. That would work in the header, as a Facebook profile picture, and as a favicon — one mark doing all three jobs. Say the word and I'll make it.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Also worth doing now:</span> if you're happy with the logo, your favicon is still Jekyll Now's default. That's a five-minute job later, not now — but it's the last thing that makes a site look unfinished when someone shares a link.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="HZuSiKa0vfxoG6v8" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_bde99da6-6591-4000-b6d9-c07f8b40a0e1-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-HZuSiKa0vfxoG6v8"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Looks cleaner now. How do I change the text next to the logo?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="93f6295c-8d1a-4da1-a8eb-05e6c449fe63" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-93f6295c-8d1a-4da1-a8eb-05e6c449fe63"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That's the desktop description line — the one that reads "News you probably missed. Underreported stories from around the world." It comes from one place, so changing it takes one edit.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Edit <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_config.yml</code>:</span></p>
<p>Find the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">description:</code> field near the top and change it:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">yaml</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-yaml overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-yaml bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">description</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"Your new text here"</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Whatever you put there replaces that sentence, both in the header and in the browser tab title, and in the meta description search engines read. One field, three jobs — which is convenient, but worth knowing before you shorten it, since a good header line and a good search snippet aren't always the same thing.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Where the site name is set:</span></p>
<p>If you meant the name "Beyond The Fold" itself — currently it's the avatar image doing that job, not text. There's no separate text name showing anymore since you replaced the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">&lt;h1&gt;</code> earlier... actually, looking at your latest screenshot, the header shows the logo, the description, and the nav — but no "Beyond The Fold" text. That's because line 25's <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">&lt;h1&gt;</code> renders <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">{{ site.name }}</code>, and <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Jekyll Now reads <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">site.name</code>, not <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">site.title</code></span> — so that heading is rendering empty.</p>
<p>To bring the name back as text alongside the description, add this to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_config.yml</code>:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">yaml</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-yaml overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-yaml bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">name</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">Beyond The Fold</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>That's the field the theme actually reads for the header heading. <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">title</code> is used for the browser tab and RSS feed. Setting both is the correct fix — it's a quirk of Jekyll Now that they're separate fields.</p>
<p>So, two lines to add or edit in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_config.yml</code>:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">yaml</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-yaml overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-yaml bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">name</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">Beyond The Fold</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">description</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"News you probably missed. Underreported stories from around the world."</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Commit, wait a minute, and your header will show the logo, the name in bold, the description underneath, and the nav — which is the arrangement I'd expect you were aiming for.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="oerqboCZjt3ewTvE" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_b9a4093f-ee8f-4e2a-aa7d-5e44aec11b79-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-oerqboCZjt3ewTvE"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>like this? Just making sure I've messed nothing else up in the process</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="0de42a94-4e03-4987-b8d7-8ea3f8009a41" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-0de42a94-4e03-4987-b8d7-8ea3f8009a41"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That's all correct — nothing else in the file is damaged. Let me walk the whole thing so you can see it properly.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">One thing to add:</span> you have <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">title:</code> on line 2 but not <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">name:</code>. The theme's header reads <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">{{ site.name }}</code> for the heading, not <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">{{ site.title }}</code>, so the bold site name will render empty. Add this under line 2:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">yaml</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25