="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15V3"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table data-streamdown="table"><thead class="bg-muted/80" data-streamdown="table-header"><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><th class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm" data-streamdown="table-header-cell">Line</th><th class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm" data-streamdown="table-header-cell">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border" data-streamdown="table-body"><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">2 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">title</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Correct — used for the browser tab and RSS</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">3 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">email: ""</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Correct — empty is fine, no contact shown</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">4 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">description</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Correct, but see below — it's now three taglines run together</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">5 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">baseurl</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Correct, capitals match your repo</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">6 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">url</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Missing <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">https://</code> — harmless, only affects share previews</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">8 <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">github_username</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Correct</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">11–13 build settings</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">All correct, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">future: true</code> is doing its job</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">16–19 colours</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Harmless — they don't change anything, as covered</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">22–23 paginate</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Safe to leave</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">26–30 exclude</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Correct</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">On line 4 — worth a second look.</span> You've combined three options I offered into one string: <em>"News you probably missed. The stories that slid past your feed. World news, off the front page."</em> That's three sentences doing the same job, and it reads as a list rather than a tagline. In the header it'll be a long line of text under your site name, and it's also what appears in Google results and link previews, where shorter is better.</p>
<p>I'd pick one. My suggestion:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">yaml</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-yaml overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-yaml bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">description</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"News you probably missed — underreported stories from around the world."</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>That's the strongest of the three ideas, and the em-dash version carries both halves in one sentence. But it's your page; if you like the rhythm of the longer one, keep it.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">On line 6:</span> the missing <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">https://</code> won't stop anything working. If you want it exact, the line is <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">url: [newsbeyondthefold.github.io](https://newsbeyondthefold.github.io)</code> — but given how that line went earlier, deleting it entirely is also fine and arguably cleaner.</p>
<p>Add the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">name:</code> line, decide on line 4, commit, and your header will show the logo, the name in bold, the description beneath, and the nav.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="Hfe4guZCrPF4lOir" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_f1e295dc-9098-4bf7-b1c1-831f8f7734e6-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end hidden" id="message-Hfe4guZCrPF4lOir"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="adf76aed-1fed-47fd-baf8-975a6636930a" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-adf76aed-1fed-47fd-baf8-975a6636930a"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That's exactly right — <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">name: Beyond The Fold</code> on line 3, and nothing else disturbed. The file is in good shape.</p>
<p>Commit it, wait a minute, and reload. Your header should now show the logo mark, "Beyond The Fold" as a bold heading, the description underneath, and the nav on the right.</p>
<p>The one thing still worth a decision is line 5 — the description is three taglines stacked together:</p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>News you probably missed. The stories that slid past your feed. World news, off the front page.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Any one of those works alone. All three in a row reads as a list, and that same string is what shows up under your site's name in Google results and in every link preview someone shares — where shorter does more work than longer. I'd keep the first:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">yaml</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-yaml overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="yaml" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-yaml bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">description</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"News you probably missed — underreported stories from around the world."</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Entirely your call, and easy to change later since it's one line.</p>
<p>Beyond that, the setup is done. What's left is the polish, in rough order of how much it matters:</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Line length.</span> In <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code>, set <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.wrapper</code> to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">max-width: 700px;</code> and add <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">line-height: 1.7;</code> to the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> rule. Articles read noticeably better with these two changes.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Delete the leftover files.</span> The stray <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">2026-10-05-your-first-article.md</code> at your repo root, and the 2014 Hello World post in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_posts</code> if it's still there.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The About page.</span> Still Jekyll Now's default text. Your version of it should say who you are, what the page covers, and how corrections get handled — that last line does a lot of work for credibility on a page like this.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The favicon.</span> Currently Jekyll Now's default on the browser tab and in shared links. It's the last thing that makes a site look unfinished. Five minutes when you're ready.</p>
<p>And from here the workflow is just repeating what you've already done: <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Add file → Create new file</span>, name it <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_posts/2026-10-06-slug.md</code>, front matter, your writing, commit.</p>
<p>Worth saying — the article you published is solid. Named source, direct quote left intact, the regional breakdown as a real list. That's a better first post than most pages in this space manage. The next step that would set it apart is adding the layer the original report didn't have: why this story didn't travel, or what it connects to. That's what turns "here's what happened" into a reason to follow.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="PvBjXxBhrRlllFO2" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-PvBjXxBhrRlllFO2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Can you walk me through the Line Length part step by step?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="2d89fa8d-8379-4db3-a6f1-b1221223c6ab" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-2d89fa8d-8379-4db3-a6f1-b1221223c6ab"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Here's the whole thing, step by step.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 1 — Open <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code></h2>
<p>In your repo's file list, click <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code>. Then click the <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">pencil icon</span> (top right of the file view) to open it for editing.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 2 — Find the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.wrapper</code> rule</h2>
<p>Press <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Ctrl+F</span> (or <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Cmd+F</span> on a Mac) to open your browser's find box, and search for:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase"></span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">.wrapper</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>You'll be taken to a block that looks roughly like this:</p>
