<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 3 — Change the width</h2>
<p>Change <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">both</span> <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">800px</code> values to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">700px</code>. Leave the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">30px</code> paddings alone. It should end up as:</p>
