<p>Note the space before the bracket — you want the plain <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> selector, not <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body.home</code> or similar. It'll look something like:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">scss</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-scss overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-scss bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">body</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> {</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">  </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">font</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">400</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">16</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #D73A49; --shiki-dark: #F97583;">px</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">/1.5</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #032F62; --shiki-dark: #9ECBFF;">"Helvetica Neue"</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">, </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">Helvetica</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">, </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">Arial</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">, </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">sans-serif</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">  </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">color</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#111</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">  </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">background-color</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#fdfdfd</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">}</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 5 — Add line spacing</h2>
<p>Look at <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">16px/1.5</code> in the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">font:</code> line. That <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.5</code> is the current line height. Change it to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.7</code>:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">scss</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-scss overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-scss bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">font</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: 400 16px/1</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #6F42C1; --shiki-dark: #B392F0;">.7</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>That single number is the whole change. <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">16px/1.7</code> means 16px text at 1.7× line spacing.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">If your <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> rule instead has a separate <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">line-height:</code> line</span>, then edit that value to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.7</code> rather than touching the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">font:</code> shorthand. Either form works — use whichever your file has.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 6 — Commit and check</h2>
<p>Scroll to the bottom, add a commit message like "Adjust text width and line spacing", and click <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Commit changes</span>. Wait a minute, reload your site, and read the article.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">What to look for</h2>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Line length:</span> count roughly how many words fit on a single line. Before, it was probably 13–15 words; at 700px you should be at 10–12. Somewhere in the 60–75 character range is the comfortable zone for reading — beyond that your eye has to hunt for the start of the next line.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Spacing:</span> paragraphs should feel airier and easier to scan.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">If something looks wrong</h2>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Nothing changed at all.</span> That means the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code> edits didn't take effect — check you committed and that the build went green in the Actions tab.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The whole page stayed wide.</span> You may have edited a <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.wrapper</code> rule inside a media query (those sit inside <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">@media</code> blocks and only apply at certain screen sizes). Use Ctrl+F to find every occurrence and make sure you edited the main one at the top level of the file.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Text got cramped instead.</span> Some themes also set a <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">padding</code> on <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.wrapper</code> that eats into the width. If 700px looks too narrow, try <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">750px</code> — there's no single correct number, and it's a two-second change to try another.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Caution on one thing:</span> <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code> is longer than <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_config.yml</code> and holds every rule for the whole site. Change only the values described here — don't delete or restructure anything, since the braces and nesting are what hold the stylesheet together. If a build fails after an edit, look for a missing <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">}</code> or a stray character, and you can always use the file's <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">History</span> button to see exactly what changed and revert it.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="ZXP2K35zY3dh0xtl" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-ZXP2K35zY3dh0xtl"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>.wrapper does not exist. I only have .wrapper masthead and .wrapper footer</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="f27b70a8-9a88-40bc-bdb4-0fe2d7756c0e" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-f27b70a8-9a88-40bc-bdb4-0fe2d7756c0e"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That's a difference in the theme version — some builds of Jekyll Now use a slightly different stylesheet. The content width lives somewhere else in yours.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Search <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code> for these instead</span>, one at a time with Ctrl+F:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase"></span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">max-width</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>That will show you every place a width is set. You're looking for one around <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">800px</code> or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">740px</code> — a value that's the main content column, not a mobile breakpoint. It's likely inside a rule with a name like <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">main</code>, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.container</code>, or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.site-info</code>.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Also try searching for:</span></p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase"></span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">.container</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Your <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">default.html</code> uses <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">class="container"</code> on the main wrapper, so that's the most likely place the width is defined in your version.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">When you find it, the change is the same:</span> reduce the pixel value to around <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">700px</code> if it's a plain <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">max-width</code>, or change the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">800px</code> to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">700px</code> if it's inside a <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">calc()</code> like before.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">One caution:</span> there may be several width values, including ones inside <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">@media</code> blocks that only apply on narrow screens. Those are for mobile — leave them. You want the one at the top level of the file that governs the desktop column.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">If nothing obvious turns up</span>, paste the relevant section into your reply or send a screenshot of what <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">max-width</code> finds, and I'll point at the exact line. Searching <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">max-width</code> should surface only a handful of results, so it's quick to scan.</p>
<p>One thing worth knowing: if your stylesheet is genuinely different from the standard one, the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> line-height search might also differ — same approach, search for <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">line-height</code> and tell me what values you see.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="oZwJ8f2Mu5snd0oU" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_12e61341-c5a0-415f-b058-0c771d5e786d-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-oZwJ8f2Mu5snd0oU"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>I changed this from 740 to 700</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="5d466baf-50c0-4633-acc7-625c77c2b6dd" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-5d466baf-50c0-4633-acc7-625c77c2b6dd"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That's the right line, and 700px is a good value. Commit it.</p>
<p><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.container</code> with <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">max-width: 700px</code> and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">margin: 0 auto</code> is exactly the rule that centres your content column — so you found the equivalent of the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.wrapper</code> I described, just under a different name in your theme version.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Now the line spacing.</span> Search <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code> for:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase"></span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">line-height</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>You'll get a few results. You're looking for one attached to the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> rule, or to a paragraph/text rule — likely a value like <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.5</code> or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.4</code>. Change it to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.7</code>.</p>
<p>If search turns up several, the one that matters is the one governing general body text, not headings (headings often have a tighter value like <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.2</code>, and that's correct — leave those).</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">One caution on <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.container</code>:</span> that class is used in three places in your <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">default.html</code> — the masthead, the main content, and the footer. Changing its width affects all three at once. That's fine and usually desirable, since it keeps the header and article aligned. But if after committing you find the header looks oddly cramped, that's why, and the fix would be a separate width for the masthead only.</p>
<p>Commit, wait a minute, then reload and read the article. Judge it by two things: whether your eye finds the start of the next line without hunting, and whether the paragraphs feel less dense than before.</p>
<p>If 700px now looks too narrow — which it might, since your article's paragraphs are long — try 740 again or 720. There's no correct number, and it's a one-character change each time.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="nr2EMoxX32vI2nXg" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_69d75c36-fd76-4cc8-a9dd-ac5300b35c9d-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-nr2EMoxX32vI2nXg"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>looks like it's already 1.7?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="ae43fa31-e91c-425f-bbd7-34e54ef35263" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-ae43fa31-e91c-425f-bbd7-34e54ef35263"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Not quite — that <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.7</code> on line 38 belongs to a different rule. It governs <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">headings</span>, not body text.</p>
<p>Look at line 33: <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {</code>. That block runs from line 33 down past 38, so the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">line-height: 1.7</code> sits inside it and applies only to headings. The <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.4</code> on line 43 is inside the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">@include mobile</code> block, so it overrides the heading spacing on small screens.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The one you want is on line 22</span>, inside your <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> rule:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">scss</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-scss overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-scss bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">body</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> {</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">  </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">background</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$white</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">  </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">font</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">18</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #D73A49; --shiki-dark: #F97583;">px</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">/1.4</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$helvetica</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">  </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">color</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$darkGray</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">}</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>That <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">18px/1.4</code> is your body text — 18px at 1.4× line spacing. Change the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.4</code> to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.7</code>:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">scss</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-scss overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-scss bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #22863A; --shiki-dark: #85E89D;">font</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">: 18px/1</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #6F42C1; --shiki-dark: #B392F0;">.7</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;"> </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$helvetica</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>That's your article text, since the theme inherits from <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code>. That single number is the whole change.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Two observations while you're here:</span></p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Your base font is 18px</span>, which is larger than I'd assumed. Combined with the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">700px</code> width, your lines will be fairly short — around 9–10 words each. That's comfortable, and arguably better than 16px text in a narrow column. Worth seeing how it reads before adjusting anything else.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Don't change the heading <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.7</code> on line 38.</span> Headings want <em>tighter</em> spacing than body text, not looser, and 1.7 is already generous for a heading. Leave it.</p>
<p>So: edit line 22, commit, and read your article. If paragraphs still feel dense, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">1.8</code> is a reasonable next step — but 1.7 is the right starting point.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="7425bX7lZ1ks3kfR" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_991205bd-c431-47e7-93f4-85c95b09aa36-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end hidden" id="message-7425bX7lZ1ks3kfR"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="bb0e4696-dc11-4648-a77a-583b6204b2ac" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-bb0e4696-dc11-4648-a77a-583b6204b2ac"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>That's correct — <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">font: 18px/1.7 $helvetica;</code> is exactly the change. Commit it.</p>
<p>Both edits are now done: <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.container</code> at 700px, and body text at 1.7 line spacing. Reload after a minute and read your article.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">What to judge:</span></p>
<p>Your text is 18px in a 700px column, which works out to roughly 9–10 words per line. That's on the comfortable side of ideal — short enough that your eye finds the next line easily. The article should feel noticeably airier than it did.</p>
<p>If it now reads as <em>too</em> airy or the column looks narrow with lots of empty margin either side, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">740px</code> is a reasonable step back. It's a one-number change, so try it if you're not sure.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Two small things still to check on the page:</span></p>
<p>The <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">.container</code> class is used in your masthead, main content and footer — so all three should now align at 700px. Worth a glance at the header to confirm it doesn't look cramped.</p>
<p>And the paragraphs in your article are quite long by web standards. The opening paragraph is around 60 words, which is fine in print but a wall on screen. For future articles, breaking them into shorter paragraphs — three or four sentences each — will do more for readability than any CSS tweak. Not a change to make now, just something worth knowing as you write.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">What's left, in order of how much it matters:</span></p>
<p>The About page still holds Jekyll Now's default text, which is currently the weakest thing on the site. Replace the body with your own words — what the page covers, and how you handle corrections. That last line earns more trust than anything else you could add.</p>
<p>Then the tidy-up: delete the stray article file at your repo root, and the 2014 Hello World post if it's still in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_posts</code>.</p>
<p>And finally the favicon — still Jekyll Now's default in browser tabs and shared links. Five minutes when you're ready, and it's the last thing that makes the site look unfinished.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="uK4z5689ORlACYyC" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_b1eaea16-c271-4071-9e64-1e32b7facb89-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-uK4z5689ORlACYyC"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>will this step make it look more polished rather than plain black and white?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="a60d87c8-3b9c-424e-afd6-a8bf9bb93049" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-a60d87c8-3b9c-424e-afd6-a8bf9bb93049"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Short answer: no, not as written. Those four lines do nothing in your theme, which is the caveat I flagged earlier and I should have been clearer about.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Why they won't work.</span> In SCSS, a <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$variable: value;</code> line only has an effect if something <em>uses</em> <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$brand-color</code> further down the file. Your theme's stylesheet uses different variable names — you can see them in the screenshot of your <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">body</code> rule: <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$white</code>, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$helvetica</code>, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$darkGray</code>. Declaring new variables at the bottom of the file doesn't retroactively change anything that's already written, and nothing in the theme references those four names.</p>
<p>So pasting them at the bottom would commit cleanly and change nothing at all on the page.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">What actually changes the colour.</span> Go to the top of <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code>, where the theme defines its own variables, and change the values there. It'll look something like:</p>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">scss</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="language-scss overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-body"><pre class="language-scss bg-[var(--sdm-bg,inherit] dark:bg-[var(--shiki-dark-bg,var(--sdm-bg,inherit)]" style="--sdm-bg: transparent; --sdm-fg: inherit;"><code class="[counter-increment:line_0] [counter-reset:line]"><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$darkGray</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">:      </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#333</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$darkerGray</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">:    </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#222</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #E36209; --shiki-dark: #FFAB70;">$white</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">:         </span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #005CC5; --shiki-dark: #79B8FF;">#fff</span><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="--sdm-c: #24292E; --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Change the hex codes to yours:</p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$white</code> → <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">#FBF8F1</code> (your cream background)</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$darkerGray</code> → <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">#12284B</code> (your navy, for headings)</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$darkGray</code> → <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">#1A1A1A</code> (your body text)</li>
</ul>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Start with just the background</span>, <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$white</code> → <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">#FBF8F1</code>. Commit, reload, and see how it looks. One change at a time means you can tell what each did, and you avoid the case where you change three things at once and can't work out which one made it worse.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">One caution:</span> <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">$white</code> may be used for more than the page background — it could also colour text that sits on dark elements, or borders. If something turns cream that shouldn't, that's why. Check the header and nav after committing.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">And a view worth considering before you do it:</span> your site currently looks clean and plain, which is not the same as unfinished. Many well-regarded news sites are white with black text and one accent colour. A cream background plus navy headings can look considered, or it can look like a template someone tinted. The honest test is to make the change, look at it, and be willing to revert. The <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">History</span> button on the file will let you undo it in seconds.</p>
<p>The thing that would make the biggest difference to how polished the site feels isn't the colour at all — it's the About page still holding Jekyll Now's default text, and the default favicon in the browser tab. Those are the visible seams.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-down h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18.12 10 14H4.17a2 2 0 0 1-1.92-2.56l2.33-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 2H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.76a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11L12 22a3.13 3.13 0 0 1-3-3.88Z"></path><path d="M17 14V2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="Gf4mg676fskJ8uTQ" data-scroll-anchor="true" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="user" data-testid="message-user"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2 items-end"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[70%] justify-end"><div class="mb-0.5 flex flex-col gap-1 w-full min-w-full" data-testid="input-attachment-preview"><div class="relative mx-auto rounded-lg flex w-full max-w-full min-w-full justify-end overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="relative flex justify-end"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-end" type="button"><img alt="image.png" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="border-border bg-background rounded-xl border max-h-64 w-auto" data-nimg="1" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_a7ff7c60-b8a6-4449-93b9-f047cd8e45d8-image.png" style="border-radius: 0.75rem; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 24rem; max-width: 16rem; object-fit: contain; object-position: center center;"></button></div></div></div></div><div role="user" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none max-w-[80%] self-end" id="message-Gf4mg676fskJ8uTQ"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full bg-[#F4F4F4] dark:bg-background text-default-800 rounded-[14px] px-3 py-2 mb-6"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Sorry, where am I copying them 3 pieces of code too?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute transition-opacity duration-200 right-0 -bottom-2"><div class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="user-copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="21124a76-a343-40ec-93fd-8f11aeb75617" data-scroll-anchor="false" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 flex flex-col" data-slot="message-scroller-item"><div class="chat-message group/message w-full animate-message-enter" data-role="assistant" data-testid="message-assistant"><div class="flex w-full min-w-full gap-4 group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:justify-end mt-4 mb-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><div role="assistant" class="relative flex gap-3 break-words hyphens-none" id="message-21124a76-a343-40ec-93fd-8f11aeb75617"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative w-full pb-8"><div data-testid="message-content"><div class="inline-block max-w-full text-start [unicode-bidi:plaintext]" dir="auto"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 chat-markdown max-w-none"><p>Not in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.scss</code> at all — that was the wrong instruction, and the screenshot confirms it. Line 9 shows <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">@import "variables"</code>, which means this theme keeps its colours in a <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">separate file</span> called <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">variables.scss</code>. That's where you edit them.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">What to do:</span></p>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Go back to your repo's file list. Look for a file named <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_sass</code> — that's a folder. Inside it you'll find <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">variables.scss</code>.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">Open <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">variables.scss</code>. That's the file holding the colour definitions as proper theme variables, all with the real names the rest of the stylesheet uses.</li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">You'll see lines much like these, with your theme's actual values:</li>
</ol>
<div class="my-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-sidebar p-2" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block" style="content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 200px;"><div class="flex h-8 items-center text-muted-foreground text-xs" data-language="scss" data-streamdown="code-block-header"><span class="ml-1 font-mono lowercase">scss</span></div><div class="pointer-events-none sticky top-2 z-10 -mt-10 flex h-8 items-center justify-end"><div class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-sidebar bg-sidebar/80 px-1.5 py-1 supports-[backdrop-filter]:bg-sidebar/70 supports-[backdrop-filter]:backdrop-blur" data-streamdown="code-block-actions"><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-download-button" title="Download file" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button><button class="cursor-pointer p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-all hover:text-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" data-streamdown="code-block-copy-button" title="Copy Code" type="button"><svg color="currentColor" height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" size="14"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25