<p>Add this line just after <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">{{ content }}</code>, before the closing <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">&lt;/article&gt;</code>:</p>
