<p>Square brackets hold the visible text. Round brackets hold the URL. That's it — those are the only two pieces.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 1 — Open your article</h2>
<p>Go to <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">_posts/2026-10-05-operation-statewide-shield.md</code>, click the pencil to edit.</p>
