<p>Now it's a link. Note the comma after the closing <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">)</code> — the sentence continues as normal, and the punctuation sits outside the link.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 5 — Check it before committing</h2>
<p>Read the line and confirm four things:</p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">One <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">[</code> and one <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">]</code></li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">One <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">(</code> and one <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">)</code></li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">No space</span> between <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">]</code> and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">(</code></li>
<li class="text-ink-primary text-t2 py-1 leading-6 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item" node="[object Object]">The URL starts with <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">https://</code> and has no spaces in it</li>
</ul>
<p>That last point is the one that catches people — a URL with a stray space breaks at that point and the link goes nowhere.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Step 6 — Commit, wait, check</h2>
<p>Commit with a message like "Add source link", wait a minute, reload, and scroll to the bottom of the article. The outlet name should be clickable and in your link colour.</p>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">Common mistakes</h2>





























<div class="my-4 flex flex-col space-y-2" data-streamdown="table-wrapper"><div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1"><div class="relative"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer select-none appearance-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent] disabled:opacity-60 h-auto w-auto rounded-lg p-1.5 text-gray-800 hover:bg-[#efefef] dark:text-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-100/10 [&amp;_svg]:size-[17px]" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-testid="table-copy" type="button" data-state="closed"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='h-'])]:h-4 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='w-'])]:w-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="relative"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer select-none appearance-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent] disabled:opacity-60 h-auto w-auto rounded-lg p-1.5 text-gray-800 hover:bg-[#efefef] dark:text-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-100/10 [&amp;_svg]:size-[17px]" aria-label="Download" data-testid="table-download" title="Download" type="button"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='h-'])]:h-4 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='w-'])]:w-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15V3"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table data-streamdown="table"><thead class="bg-muted/80" data-streamdown="table-header"><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><th class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm" data-streamdown="table-header-cell">What you typed</th><th class="whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm" data-streamdown="table-header-cell">What happens</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border" data-streamdown="table-body"><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">[text] (url)</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Space before the bracket — renders as literal text, not a link</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">[text]( url )</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Spaces inside the brackets — can still work but is fragile</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">(text)[url]</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Round brackets first — nothing renders as a link</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">[text]((url))</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Double brackets — breaks</td></tr><tr class="border-border" data-streamdown="table-row"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Missing <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">https://</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-sm" data-streamdown="table-cell">Renders as a link but goes nowhere</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<h2 class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown="heading-2">The habit for future articles</h2>
<p>Once you've done it a few times, you'll type it without thinking. The pattern to remember: <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">square brackets for what you see, round brackets for where it goes, no gap between them.</span></p>
<p>One tip: paste the URL in first as plain text, check it's complete, then wrap it — rather than typing the whole thing in one go. Copying a URL out of a browser is where stray spaces and truncated addresses creep in. That's what went wrong with the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">url:</code> line in your config earlier, and the same trap applies here.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 transition-opacity duration-200 left-0"><div class="flex gap-1"><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="copy-to-clipboard-button" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-upvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up h-[17px] w-[17px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg></button><button class="message-action-button p-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" data-testid="message-downvote" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-l