<p>The address goes in <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">both</span> places — once inside the square brackets as the visible text, once after <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">mailto:</code>. Keep the <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">mailto:</code> prefix, or the link won't open an email app when clicked.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">The rest of the page body is still placeholder text</span>, so replace lines 7 through 15 with your own version. Here's one to edit — swap in your own voice where it reads as mine:</p>
