ne interior line work. Keep only three flat shapes — the navy circle, the cream tilted page, and the gold fold triangle — bold, chunky and high contrast, filling roughly eighty percent of the frame, with crisp flat edges. Same navy, cream and gold colours as the original. in full screen" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] cursor-pointer w-full" data-image-card="0" role="button" tabindex="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 100%; max-height: 600px; aspect-ratio: 1024 / 1024;"><img alt="Edit: Redraw this exact logo mark as a drastically simplified version for use as a tiny browser tab icon. Keep the same identity and the same circular badge silhouette: the navy filled circle, the cream square page tilted inside it, and the gold triangular folded corner at the page's top right. Remove the lettering entirely, remove any small text, remove the outer cream border ring, and remove all fine interior line work. Keep only three flat shapes — the navy circle, the cream tilted page, and the gold fold triangle — bold, chunky and high contrast, filling roughly eighty percent of the frame, with crisp flat edges. Same navy, cream and gold colours as the original." class="size-full rounded-[14px] object-cover transition-all duration-300" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_2529d67f-7419-487c-949e-38efba036e7e-agentic-image-1791244862222-0.jpeg"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/0 transition-all duration-200 group-hover:bg-black/20"><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer select-none appearance-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent] dark:hover:bg-gray-100/10 disabled:opacity-60 h-9 w-9 h-8! w-8! rounded-[8px] border-none bg-white/5 text-white hover: