nd the pale gold globe showing through the fold with its graticule lines and small compass needle. Delete only the outer thin navy circle ring, delete all lettering including the words BEYOND and THE FOLD, and delete the flat cream background so the background becomes the same deep navy as the mark itself. Redraw everything as bold, chunky, high-contrast flat shapes with strong outlines, filling roughly eighty-five percent of the square frame edge to edge with almost no margin, no drop shadow, no glow, and no soft edges. Keep the same navy, cream and warm gold palette. The result must still read clearly when scaled down to sixteen pixels." class="size-full rounded-[14px] object-cover transition-all duration-300" src="./favicon_files/chat_files_83ee75b8-1142-4cc0-85a3-66816d6b0146-agentic-image-1791244896508-0.jpeg"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/0 transition-all duration-200 group-hover:bg-black/20"><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer select-none appearance-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent] dark:hover:bg-gray-100/10 disabled:opacity-60 h-9 w-9 h-8! w-8! rounded-[8px] border-none bg-white/5 text-white hover:bg-white/20 hover:backdrop-blur-sm" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye h-4! w-4! text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button></div><div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 flex gap-2 opaci