e in a chat.\",\"edit_instructions_placeholder\":\"Think step by step and show reasoning for complex problems. Use specific examples.\",\"empty_chats_simple\":\"Start a chat to keep conversations organized and re-use project knowledge.\",\"filter_your_chats\":\"Your chats\",\"last_message_days_ago\":\"Last updated {count, plural, one {# day} other {# days}} ago\",\"last_message_hours_ago\":\"Last updated {count, plural, one {# hour} other {# hours}} ago\",\"last_message_just_now\":\"Last updated just now\",\"last_message_minutes_ago\":\"Last updated {count, plural, one {# minute} other {# minutes}} ago\",\"last_message_months_ago\":\"Last updated {count, plural, one {# month} other {# months}} ago\",\"last_message_years_ago\":\"Last updated {count, plural, one {# year} other {# years}} ago\",\"modal_project_goal_label\":\"What are you trying to achieve?\",\"modal_project_goal_placeholder\":\"Describe what this project is about\",\"modal_project_name_label\":\"What are you working on?\",\"modal_project_name_placeholder\":\"Name your project\",\"modal_project_title\":\"Create project\",\"preview_files_placeholder\":\"Add PDFs, documents, or other text to reference in this project.\",\"preview_files_title\":\"Files\",\"preview_instructions_placeholder\":\"Add instructions to tailor Use.ai's responses\",\"preview_instructions_title\":\"Instructions\",\"rename_chat\":\"Rename chat\",\"rename_chat_title\":\"Rename Chat\",\"save\":\"Save\",\"save_instructions\":\"Save instructions\",\"saving\":\"Saving…\",\"show_less\":\"Show less\",\"show_more\":\"Show more\",\"toast_private_project_created\":\"Private project created\",\"error_chat_generation_unsupported\":\"This chat can't be added to a project yet. Try creating the project without it.\"},\"ProjectHero\":{\"btn_add_files\":\"Add files\",\"btn_project_settings\":\"Project Settings\"},\"ImageLanding\":{\"style_examples_label\":\"{name} style\",\"style_examples_heading\":\"Examples of what you'll get\",\"prompt_what_to_generate\":\"Describe any image you want to create\",\"prompt_what_to_generate_v2\":\"Describe the image you want to generate or upload a photo and edit it with AI\",\"prompt_what_to_generate_h1_b\":\"Welcome to Use AI, Start your first creation!\",\"prompt_what_to_generate_h1_c\":\"AI Image Generator: Convert Text Prompts into Visuals\",\"generate_image_from_reference\":\"inspired by the uploaded reference photo\",\"generate_image_from_pasted_content\":\"Generate an image from the pasted content:\",\"generate_image_prompt_prefix\":\"Generate an image with this description: {description}\",\"generate_images_prompt_prefix\":\"Generate {count} variations with this description: {description}\",\"prompt_style_suffix\":\"Style: {label}\",\"prompt_aspect_ratio\":\"Aspect ratio: {label}\",\"prompt_model\":\"Model: {label}\",\"aspect_ratio_label\":\"Aspect ratio\",\"style_label\":\"Style\",\"style_none\":\"None\",\"style_realistic\":\"Realistic\",\"style_cartoon\":\"Cartoon\",\"style_3d\":\"3D Render\",\"style_anime\":\"Anime\",\"style_digital_art\":\"Digital\",\"style_abstract\":\"Abstract\",\"ratio_1_1\":\"1:1 (Square)\",\"ratio_4_3\":\"4:3 (Standard)\",\"ratio_3_4\":\"3:4 (Portrait)\",\"ratio_16_9\":\"16:9 (Widescreen)\",\"ratio_9_16\":\"9:16 (Mobile)\",\"ratio_21_9\":\"21:9 (Ultrawide)\",\"variations_1\":\"1 image\",\"variations_2\":\"2 images\",\"variations_4\":\"4 images\",\"gallery_title\":\"My images\",\"gallery_loading\":\"Loading images…\",\"image_unavailable\":\"Image unavailable\",\"modal_subtitle\":\"Discover something new\",\"modal_recents\":\"Recents\",\"modal_choose_photo\":\"Choose a new photo\",\"modal_cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"discover_prompt_cartoon\":\"Turn me into a cartoon character\",\"discover_prompt_headshot\":\"Create a professional headshot\",\"discover_prompt_pet_royalty\":\"Make my pet look like royalty\",\"discover_prompt_superhero\":\"What would I look like as a superhero?\",\"discover_prompt_watercolor\":\"Transform my photo into a watercolor painting\",\"discover_prompt_action_figure\":\"Turn me into an action figure\",\"style_prompt_realistic\":\"Transform my uploaded photo into a hyper-realistic, high-definition image. Enhance the lighting, textures, and details to make it look like a professionally shot photograph with perfect clarity, natural colors, and cinematic depth of field.\",\"style_prompt_cartoon\":\"Transform my uploaded photo into a vibrant cartoon illustration. Reimagine the subject with bold outlines, exaggerated features, bright saturated colors, and a fun animated style similar to modern animated movies.\",\"style_prompt_3d\":\"Transform my uploaded photo into a high-quality 3D render. Reimagine the subject as a detailed 3D model with smooth surfaces, studio lighting, subtle shadows, and a polished three-dimensional appearance like a Pixar or CGI character.\",\"style_prompt_anime\":\"Transform my uploaded photo into anime art style. Reimagine the subject with large expressive eyes, stylized hair, clean line art, and the distinctive aesthetic of Japanese anime with dramatic lighting and vivid colors.\",\"style_prompt_digital_art\":\"Transform my uploaded photo into a stunning piece of digital art. Reimagine the subject with creative digital painting techniques, rich color palettes, artistic brushstrokes, and a modern digital illustration aesthetic.\",\"style_prompt_abstract\":\"Transform my uploaded photo into an abstract artwork. Reimagine the subject using geometric shapes, bold color blocks, surreal compositions, and artistic abstraction while keeping the essence of the original recognizable.\",\"discover_prompt_text_cartoon\":\"Take my uploaded photo and transform me into a fun cartoon character. Reimagine my appearance as if I were a character in a Pixar or Disney animated movie — use bold outlines, exaggerated but flattering features, vibrant colors, and an expressive animated style. Keep my likeness recognizable.\",\"discover_prompt_text_headshot\":\"Take my uploaded photo and create a professional business headshot. Enhance the lighting, sharpen the details, use a clean neutral or gradient background, ensure professional attire and posture, and make me look polished and confident — as if shot by a professional portrait photographer.\",\"discover_prompt_text_pet_royalty\":\"Take my uploaded photo and reimagine my pet as royalty. Dress them in regal attire like a crown, royal cape, and jewels. Place them on an ornate throne or in a grand palace setting. Make it look like an official royal portrait painting with dramatic lighting and rich, opulent details.\",\"discover_prompt_text_superhero\":\"Take my uploaded photo and transform me into a superhero. Give me a unique, original superhero costume with a cape, mask or emblem, and superhero-like physique. Place me in a dramatic action pose with a cityscape or epic background. Add visual effects like energy auras, wind, or dramatic lighting.\",\"discover_prompt_text_watercolor\":\"Take my uploaded photo and transform it into a beautiful watercolor painting. Use soft, flowing watercolor brushstrokes, gentle color bleeds, translucent washes, and the characteristic paper texture of traditional watercolor art. Keep the composition recognizable but with an artistic, hand-painted quality.\",\"discover_prompt_text_action_figure\":\"Take my uploaded photo and reimagine me as a collectible action figure displayed in its packaging. Show me as a detailed action figure with a plastic-like texture, articulated joints, and accessories. Include realistic toy packaging with a clear window, colorful backing card, and product branding.\",\"enhancer_headline\":\"Upload a photo to enhance and upscale with AI\",\"enhancer_prompt_prefix\":\"Enhance and upscale my image.\",\"send_button_generate\":\"Generate\",\"enhancer_redesign_headline\":\"\u003caccent\u003eEnhance\u003c/accent\u003e any photo in seconds\",\"enhancer_redesign_subtitle\":\"Upload any photo and get a sharp, upscaled result in seconds.\",\"enhancer_redesign_upload_cta\":\"Click or drag an image here\",\"enhancer_redesign_upload_formats\":\"JPG, JPEG, PNG, WEBP, HEIC\",\"enhancer_redesign_upload_button\":\"Upload image\",\"enhancer_redesign_uploading\":\"Uploading…\",\"enhancer_redesign_before_label\":\"BEFORE\",\"enhancer_redesign_after_label\":\"AFTER\",\"enhancer_redesign_drop_image_anywhere\":\"Drop image anywhere\",\"enhancer_redesign_enhance_button\":\"Enhance image\",\"enhancer_redesign_file_alert\":\"Only JPG, PNG, WebP and HEIC images are supported.\",\"surprise_me_button\":\"Surprise me — generate something random\",\"gallery_load_failed\":\"Failed to load images\"},\"BackgroundLanding\":{\"hero_title\":\"\u003caccent\u003eAI\u003c/accent\u003e Background Removal\",\"hero_title_variant_b\":\"\u003caccent\u003eRemove\u003c/accent\u003e any background in seconds\",\"hero_subtitle\":\"Upload any photo and get a sharp, clean cutout in seconds.\",\"social_proof_hd_download\":\"HD Download\",\"social_proof_image_enhancer\":\"Image Enhancer\",\"social_proof_formats\":\"JPG, PNG, WEBP, HEIC\",\"social_proof_daily\":\"5M+ images generated daily\",\"showcase_title\":\"Background removed, now what?\",\"showcase_swap\":\"Swap color\",\"showcase_transparent\":\"Transparent background\",\"showcase_new_bg\":\"New background\",\"showcase_possibilities\":\"Endless possibilities\",\"features_heading\":\"Built for Every Workflow\",\"features_subtitle\":\"From quick personal edits to high-volume professional workflows.\",\"feature_for_individuals_title\":\"For Individuals\",\"feature_for_individuals_description\":\"Profile pictures, social media posts, and personal projects.\",\"feature_for_freelancers_title\":\"For Freelancers\",\"feature_for_freelancers_description\":\"Client deliverables, mockups, and portfolio pieces.\",\"feature_for_marketing_title\":\"For Marketing\",\"feature_for_marketing_description\":\"Campaign assets, banners, and ad creatives at scale.\",\"feature_for_developers_title\":\"For Developers\",\"feature_for_developers_description\":\"API-ready integration for automated image pipelines.\",\"feature_for_ecommerce_title\":\"For Ecommerce\",\"feature_for_ecommerce_description\":\"Clean product shots on white or transparent backgrounds.\",\"feature_for_enterprise_title\":\"For Enterprise\",\"feature_for_enterprise_description\":\"Bulk processing with consistent, brand-ready output.\",\"before_after_heading\":\"See the Difference\",\"before_after_subtitle\":\"Sharp, clean cuts across people, products, animals, and more.\",\"before_after_tab_people\":\"People\",\"before_after_tab_products\":\"Products\",\"before_after_tab_animals\":\"Animals\",\"before_after_tab_cars\":\"Cars\",\"upload_click_or_drag\":\"Click or drag an image here\",\"upload_unsupported_file_alert\":\"Only JPG, PNG, WebP and HEIC images are supported.\",\"upload_formats\":\"JPG, JPEG, PNG, WEBP, HEIC\",\"upload_uploading\":\"Uploading…\",\"upload_starting\":\"Starting…\",\"upload_remove_background\":\"Remove Background\",\"upload_button\":\"Upload image\",\"drop_image_anywhere\":\"Drop image anywhere\",\"background_removal_prompt\":\"Remove the background from this image and make it fully transparent\"},\"MessagePastedText\":{\"label_pasted\":\"Pasted\",\"label_characters\":\"characters\",\"pasted_content_title\":\"Pasted Content\",\"label_text\":\"Text\",\"label_click_to_edit\":\"Click to edit\",\"label_click_to_view\":\"Click to view\",\"label_changes_save_automatically\":\"Changes save automatically as you edit\"},\"AppsLanding\":{\"label_useful_tools\":\"Useful tools\",\"background_removal_title\":\"Background Removal\",\"image_enhancer_title\":\"Image Enhancer\"},\"ChatExamples\":{\"email\":{\"title\":\"Help me write (example)\",\"user_1\":\"I need to write an email to my manager requesting time off next month. I want it to sound professional but not too formal. Here's what I want to say: I need 5 days off from March 10-14 for a family event.\",\"assistant_1\":\"Here's a polished version of your time-off request:\\n\\nSubject: Time Off Request - March 10-14\\n\\nHi [Manager's name],\\n\\nI hope you're doing well. I'd like to request time off from Monday, March 10 through Friday, March 14 for a family event.\\n\\nI'll make sure all current tasks and deadlines are covered before I leave, and I'm happy to coordinate handoff with the team.\\n\\nPlease let me know if you need any additional details.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n[Your name]\\n\\n---\\n\\nWant me to adjust the tone, add more context, or make it shorter?\",\"user_2\":\"Can you make it shorter? Just 2-3 sentences.\",\"assistant_2\":\"Subject: Time Off Request - March 10-14\\n\\nHi [Manager's name],\\n\\nI'd like to request time off from March 10-14 for a family event. All current work will be covered before I leave. Let me know if you need anything else.\\n\\nBest,\\n[Your name]\\n\\n---\\n\\nDone. Want me to adjust anything else?\"},\"logo\":{\"title\":\"Create a logo (example)\",\"user_1\":\"I'm starting a small coffee shop called \\\"Morning Ritual\\\" and need a logo. I want something clean and modern, maybe with a coffee cup icon.\",\"prompt_1\":\"Clean modern logo for a coffee shop called Morning Ritual, minimal coffee cup silhouette with steam forming a subtle sunrise motif, contemporary sans-serif typography, black and white\",\"assistant_1\":\"Here's a clean, modern logo concept for Morning Ritual. It features a minimal coffee cup silhouette with steam forming a subtle sunrise motif. The typography uses a contemporary sans-serif font.\\n\\nWant me to try a different style, change colors, or adjust the icon?\",\"user_2\":\"I like it but can you try it with earth tones? Brown and cream instead of black.\",\"prompt_2\":\"Clean modern logo for a coffee shop called Morning Ritual, minimal coffee cup silhouette with steam forming a subtle sunrise motif, contemporary sans-serif typography, earth tones, deep brown icon, rich cream background\",\"assistant_2\":\"Here's the updated version with warm earth tones - deep brown for the icon and rich cream for the background. The warm palette gives it a more inviting, artisanal feel.\\n\\nWant me to create variations, add a tagline, or prepare files for different sizes?\"},\"resume\":{\"title\":\"Review my resume (example)\",\"user_1\":\"I'm applying for a marketing manager position. Can you review my resume and tell me what to improve?\",\"assistant_1\":\"I reviewed your resume. Here are the key areas to improve:\\n\\n- Your summary is too generic. It should mention your specific experience in marketing and measurable results you achieved.\\n\\n- The work experience section lists responsibilities but not outcomes. For example, instead of \\\"Managed social media accounts,\\\" try \\\"Grew social media engagement by 45% over 6 months.\\\"\\n\\n- Skills section is missing keywords from typical marketing manager job descriptions, such as campaign analytics, budget management, and A/B testing.\\n\\n- The formatting is clean, but your most recent role should have more detail than older positions.\\n\\nWant me to rewrite your summary, or suggest stronger bullet points for a specific role?\",\"user_2\":\"Can you rewrite the summary for me?\",\"assistant_2\":\"Here is an updated summary based on your resume:\\n\\n\\\"Marketing professional with 5 years of experience in digital campaigns, content strategy, and team leadership. Proven track record of increasing engagement and driving revenue growth through data-driven marketing initiatives. Skilled in SEO, paid media, email marketing, and cross-functional collaboration.\\\"\\n\\nThis version highlights your experience, mentions specific skills, and focuses on outcomes. Want me to adjust it for a different role, or work on your bullet points next?\"}},\"Connectors\":{\"page_title\":\"Connectors\",\"page_title_apps\":\"Apps\",\"page_subtitle\":\"Connect third-party services to your AI assistant\",\"mobile_subtitle\":\"Connect your tools and manage access in one place.\",\"desktop_heading\